uired_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cSpace Grunts is not your typical Rogue-lite game. By taking the design concepts from action titles and applying them to the dungeon crawling gameplay formula, OrangePixel have found a combination that synchronizes into some really enjoyable gameplay experience.\u201d<br><br><br>\u201cUnderlying all the carnage is a game about limited resources. You're not just shuffling between guns to get the spatial drop on your foes, you're conserving different types of ammo for different situations\u201d<br><br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s an attractive game, with just the right amount of screen-shudder and lovely pixel-gobbets of flesh and metal bouncing around the play area when a rocket hits the mark.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371430/ss_f54de14ae9cc0e25085ba1d8e5b52a2572a8974b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772450459","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371430/ss_f54de14ae9cc0e25085ba1d8e5b52a2572a8974b.600x338.jpg?t=1772450459"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371430/ss_8b1b0b2bb149985aad29e5f8c8501f4e4f71e03f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772450459","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371430/ss_8b1b0b2bb149985aad29e5f8c8501f4e4f71e03f.600x338.jpg?t=1772450459"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371430/ss_d05b2091cef8158785feb0950bab2b6629233fef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772450459","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371430/ss_d05b2091cef8158785feb0950bab2b6629233fef.600x338.jpg?t=1772450459"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/371430/ss_f8785a61b7429ab184a547f55023127ca4f848b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772450459","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets